\end{center}
\[
\Delta \overrightarrow{v}_{2} = -v_{\theta}\omega\,dt\,\overrightarrow{e}_{r} = -\omega^{2}R\,dt\,\overrightarrow{e}_{r}
\]

径向速度改变：
\begin{center}
\includegraphics[max width=0.4\textwidth]{images/10_8_1583_544_499_0.jpg}
\end{center}
\[
\Delta \overrightarrow{v}_{3} = \overrightarrow{v}_{r}(C) - \overrightarrow{v}_{r}(B) = 0
\]

横向速度改变量：
\[
\Delta \overrightarrow{v}_{t} = \overrightarrow{v}_{\theta}(C) - \overrightarrow{v}_{\theta}(B)
\]
\[
\Delta \overrightarrow{v}_{\theta} = v_{r}\omega\Delta t\,\overrightarrow{e}_{\theta}
\]

\[
\overrightarrow{a} = \lim_{\Delta t \rightarrow 0}\frac{\Delta \overrightarrow{v}}{\Delta t} = \lim_{\Delta t \rightarrow 0}\frac{-\omega^{2}R\Delta t\,\overrightarrow{e}_{r} + 2v_{r}\omega\Delta t\,\overrightarrow{e}_{\theta}}{\Delta t} = -\omega^{2}R\,\overrightarrow{e}_{r} + 2v_{r}\omega\,\overrightarrow{e}_{\theta}
\]

\[
a_{r} = -\omega^{2}R,\quad a_{\theta} = 2v_{r}\omega,\quad \overline{a}_{c} = -2\overline{v} \times \overline{\omega}
\]

\[
\overrightarrow{F}_{\text{离}} = m\omega^{2}\overrightarrow{R},\quad \overrightarrow{F}_{c} = 2m\overrightarrow{v}_{r} \times \overrightarrow{\omega}
\]

惯性离心力 \quad 横向惯性力——科里奥利力

若质点在转动非惯性系中的速度是斜的，则
\[
\overrightarrow{F}_{c} = 2m\overrightarrow{v}_{r} \times \overrightarrow{\omega} + 2m\overrightarrow{v}_{\theta} \times \overrightarrow{\omega}
\]

