横向科氏力 \quad 径向科氏力

\textbf{另一种推导：}

\[
\overrightarrow{v} = \omega r\overrightarrow{j} + v_{0}\overrightarrow{i}
\]
\[
\overrightarrow{a} = \frac{d\overrightarrow{v}}{dt} = \frac{d}{dt}(\omega r\overrightarrow{j} + v_{0}\overrightarrow{i})
\]
\[
= \omega\left(\frac{dr}{dt}\overrightarrow{j} + r\frac{d\overrightarrow{j}}{dt}\right) + v_{0}\frac{d\overrightarrow{i}}{dt}
\]
\[
= \omega(v_{0}\overrightarrow{j} - \omega r\overrightarrow{i}) + \omega v_{0}\overrightarrow{j}
\]
\[
= 2\omega v_{0}\overrightarrow{j} - \omega^{2}r\overrightarrow{i}
\]

