$M\dfrac{d^{2}\overrightarrow{R}}{dt^{2}} = \overline{f}' = -\overline{f}$。

\[
\frac{d^{2}(\overrightarrow{r} - \overrightarrow{R})}{dt^{2}} = \left(\frac{1}{m} + \frac{1}{M}\right)\overrightarrow{f} = \frac{m + M}{mM}\overrightarrow{f}
\]

引入约化质量 $\mu = \dfrac{mM}{m + M}$：$\mu\dfrac{d^{2}\overrightarrow{r}'}{dt^{2}} = \overrightarrow{f}$。

当 $M \gg m$ 时 $\mu \approx m$，近似为 $m\dfrac{d^{2}\overrightarrow{r}}{dt^{2}} = \overrightarrow{f}$。$\dfrac{\Delta\mu}{\mu} \approx \dfrac{m}{M}$。

日地两体 $M = 3.3 \times 10^{5}m$，粒子散射 $M = 100m$。

