\textbf{3. 常微分方程 (ODE)}

分离变量法：$y' = \dfrac{dy}{dx} = f(x,y) = \dfrac{g(x)}{h(y)}$，$h(y)\,dy = g(x)\,dx$，$\displaystyle\int_{y_{0}}^{y} h(y)\,dy = \int_{x_{0}}^{x} g(x)\,dx$ 变上限积分。

\textbf{例2.} 沿光滑直铁轨设置 $x$ 轴，火车功率额定行驶，$va = c = \text{constant}$，设 $t = 0$ 时，$x = 0,\;v = v_{0}$。

$v\dfrac{dv}{dt} = c$，$v\,dv = c\,dt$，$\displaystyle\int_{v_{0}}^{v} v\,dv = \int_{0}^{t} c\,dt$，$\dfrac{1}{2}(v^{2} - v_{0}^{2}) = ct$，$v = \sqrt{v_{0}^{2} + 2ct}$ \textcircled{1}。

求导：$a = \dfrac{c}{v} = \dfrac{c}{\sqrt{v_{0}^{2} + 2ct}}$。

$c = av = a\dfrac{dx}{dt} = a^{2}\dfrac{dx}{dv}$，$\dfrac{dx}{dv} = \dfrac{c}{a^{2}} = \dfrac{v^{2}}{c}$。$c\,dx = v^{2}\,dv$，$\displaystyle\int_{0}^{x} c\,dx = \int_{v_{0}}^{v} v^{2}\,dv$。

$cx = \dfrac{1}{3}v^{3} - \dfrac{1}{3}v_{0}^{3}$，$x = \dfrac{1}{3c}(v^{3} - v_{0}^{3})$ \textcircled{2}。

将 \textcircled{1} 代入 \textcircled{2}：$x = \dfrac{(v_{0}^{2} + 2ct)^{3/2} - v_{0}^{3}}{3c}$。

