$x_{1}(t) = A\cos(\omega_{1}t + \varphi)$，$x_{2}(t) = A\cos(\omega_{2}t + \varphi)$。频率满足 $\omega_{2} \approx \omega_{1}$，$\omega_{2} - \omega_{1} \ll \omega_{2} + \omega_{1}$。

\[
= 2A\cos\!\left(\frac{\omega_{2} - \omega_{1}}{2}t\right)\cos\!\left(\frac{\omega_{2} + \omega_{1}}{2}t\right)
\]

拍：振幅随时间周期性变化。拍频：单位时间内振幅强弱变化的次数。

\textbf{两个相互垂直的振动合成}

(1) $\omega_{1} = \omega_{2}$

\[
\frac{x^{2}}{A_{1}^{2}} + \frac{y^{2}}{A_{2}^{2}} - 2\frac{xy}{A_{1}A_{2}}\cos\delta = \sin^{2}\delta,\quad \delta = \varphi_{2} - \varphi_{1}
\]
轨道为椭圆。

当 $\Delta\varphi = 0,\pi$ 时，轨道为直线。

当 $\Delta\varphi = \pm\frac{\pi}{2}$ 时，轨道为正椭圆（右旋/左旋）。

\[
\frac{\omega_{x}}{\omega_{y}} = \frac{y\text{ 极点数}}{x\text{ 极点数}}
\]

(2) 当频率不同时：$\omega_{1}/\omega_{2}$ 为简单整数比时，轨道是稳定的闭合曲线（李萨如图形）。为无理数时不稳定。

\textbf{振动的分解——傅立叶分析}

一个周期函数可分解为一系列不同频率简谐函数叠加：
\[
X(t) = X_{0} + \sum_{n} a_{n}\cos(2\pi f_{n}t) + \sum_{n} b_{n}\sin(2\pi f_{n}t)
\]
\[
= X_{0} + \sum_{n} \sqrt{a_{n}^{2} + b_{n}^{2}}\cos(2\pi f_{n}t + \varphi_{n})
\]
\[
X_{0} = \frac{1}{T}\int_{-T/2}^{T/2} x(t)\,dt,\quad a_{n} = \frac{2}{T}\int_{-T/2}^{T/2} x(t)\cos(2\pi f_{n}t)\,dt
\]
\[
b_{n} = \frac{2}{T}\int_{-T/2}^{T/2} x(t)\sin(2\pi f_{n}t)\,dt,\quad \varphi_{n} = -\arctan\frac{b_{n}}{a_{n}}
\]
$f_{1} = \frac{1}{T}$，$f_{n} = nf_{1}$。

\textbf{例：} 矩形周期函数 $x(t) = \begin{cases} A & t \in [nT, nT + t_{0}] \\ 0 & t \in [nT + t_{0}, (n+1)T] \end{cases}$

$x'(t) = A + A\sin\omega_{1}t + \frac{A}{3}\sin 3\omega_{1}t + \cdots$

\section{8.3 弹簧系统的自由振动}

\textbf{1. 一维弹簧振子}

1) 受力特点：$f = -kx$，线性恢复力。

2) 动力学方程：$f = ma = m\dfrac{d^{2}x}{dt^{2}}$，$\dfrac{d^{2}x}{dt^{2}} = -\dfrac{k}{m}x$，二阶常微分方程。

$\omega_{0} = \sqrt{\dfrac{k}{m}}$ 弹簧振子的固有频率。

\[
\frac{d^{2}x}{dt^{2}} + \omega_{0}^{2}x = 0 \quad\text{自由振动的标准方程}
\]

通解形式：$x(t) = A\cos(\omega_{0}t + \varphi_{0})$。

$x(t) = C_{1}e^{i\omega t} + C_{2}e^{-i\omega t}$，$C_{1} = \frac{A}{2}e^{i\varphi_{0}}$，$C_{2} = \frac{A}{2}e^{-i\varphi_{0}}$。

\textbf{2. 本征频率、振幅和初相位}

$A,\varphi_{0}$ 的求法：
\[
\begin{cases}
x_{0} = A\cos\varphi_{0} \\
v_{0} = -A\omega_{0}\sin\varphi_{0}
\end{cases}
\]
\[
A = \sqrt{x_{0}^{2} + \frac{v_{0}^{2}}{\omega_{0}^{2}}},\quad \varphi_{0} = -\arctan\frac{v_{0}}{x_{0}\omega_{0}}
\]

\textbf{3. 复摆，单摆，等时摆}

\[
I\frac{d^{2}\theta}{dt^{2}} = M_{z} = -mgr_{c}\sin\theta
\]
\[
\frac{d^{2}\theta}{dt^{2}} + \frac{mgr_{c}}{I}\sin\theta = 0
\]

摆角较小时，$\sin\theta \approx \theta$：$\dfrac{d^{2}\theta}{dt^{2}} + \dfrac{mgr_{c}}{I}\theta = 0$。

\[
\theta = \theta_{0}\cos(\omega_{0}t + \varphi_{0}),\quad \omega_{0} = \sqrt{\frac{mgr_{c}}{I}}
\]

单摆：$I = ml^{2}$，$r_{c} = l$，$\omega_{0} = \sqrt{\dfrac{g}{l}}$，$T = 2\pi\sqrt{\dfrac{l}{g}}$。等时摆。

