$\nabla = \dfrac{\partial}{\partial x}\overrightarrow{i} + \dfrac{\partial}{\partial y}\overrightarrow{j} + \dfrac{\partial}{\partial z}\overrightarrow{k}$。$\displaystyle\oiint_{S}\overrightarrow{A}\cdot d\overrightarrow{S} = \iiint_{V}(\nabla\cdot\overrightarrow{A})\,dV$。

